  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2273\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2273</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2273\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=KIr&amp;datanum=2273\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2273\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2273\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 글 마지막에 썼던 내용을 아래에 옮겨보면</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">-------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">조만간</span><br><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">제미나이나 챗gpt가 예매까지 할 것 같지만</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">&quot;소요시간 가장 짧은 것으로</span><br><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">오전9시 전에 익산역에 도착하는 기차로 예매해줘</span><br><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">내 결제방식알지?&quot;</span><br><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 프롬프트 쓰거나 말하면</span><br><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">예매가 되는 시대가</span><br><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">곧 옵니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">-----------------</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">그 시대(?)가 왔어요 ;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">AI 에이전트 시대</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">OpenClaw</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://namu.wiki/w/OpenClaw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://namu.wiki/w/OpenClaw</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"OpenClaw\" data-og-description=\"THE AI THAT ACTUALLY DOES THINGS. 실제로 일을 수행하는 AI. OpenClaw(전 Cla\" data-og-host=\"namu.wiki\" data-og-source-url=\"https://namu.wiki/w/OpenClaw\" data-og-url=\"https://namu.wiki/w/OpenClaw\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://namu.wiki/w/OpenClaw\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://namu.wiki/w/OpenClaw\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">OpenClaw</p><p class=\"og-desc\">THE AI THAT ACTUALLY DOES THINGS. 실제로 일을 수행하는 AI. OpenClaw(전 Cla</p><p class=\"og-host\">namu.wiki</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/qFwumv7__Ao?si=VK1hDygrmv0rYylb\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/qFwumv7__Ao?si=VK1hDygrmv0rYylb</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qFwumv7__Ao\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/fpn6n/dJMb82eMgAb/v4KCd6KxYVYNufg2MOukwk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/crLsuP/dJMb86nWMyO/V3q5vuxPhkIz3OEWzWuFvK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qFwumv7__Ao\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">Mac mini 구매하여 설정하면 가능하다고 합니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">Mac mini 구매가 이제 인류가 구매하는 마지막 구매일수도 있다는.....</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">마지막 구매를 해야할지 말지?!?!?</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">----</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제 업무&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이제 거의다 AI가 만든 프로그램으로 하고 있는데</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">벌써 제 업무를 아예 AI에게 맡겨버려야 하는.....</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
